However, the disk drive, which is scsi id 0 attached to controller 0 on
the swxcr, is not recognized. When we run doconfig, as expected, we get
the follwing entry in the config file:
controller      xcr0       at eisa0     slot  8 vector    xcrintr 
However, we get no re entries. If we go ahead and build the kernel and
reboot from it we can't use disklabel (disklabel -z gives a message saying
it can't read the label from re0a). If we copy the following lines (from
