> is possible, it is the first I am questioning). 

Yes, you can do an update from 2.0 to 3.0. 

You CANNOT do an update from 3.0 to 3.2c. You will then need to update
to 3.2 before going to 3.2c.  The update path is as follows:

 	2.0 -> 3.0 -> 3.2 -> 3.2c -> 4.0

