This may not vbe what you are looking for, but page size on Alpha processors,
and the software running on them, is hardware dependent with the archetecture
spec allowing page size from (I think) 4KB to 64KB. I know OpenVMS will support
any page size in this range and I believe Digital UNIX will do so, as well.

