Only two files is need to rewrite:
  /etc/auth/system/devassign and
                ../ttys

in devassign:
  MyHost\:0|MyHost\:0.0:v_devs=MyHost\:0,MyHost\:0.0:v_type=xdisplay:chkent:

in ttys:
  MyHost\:0|MyHost\:0.0:t_devname=MyHost\:0:t_xdisplay:chkent:

On my host (DEC2000/300 OSF/1 v3.2) this is worked.

